  "medicalDisclaimer": "Medical disclaimer",
  "medicalDisclaimerBody": "This app is not a medical device and does not provide a diagnosis.\n\nThe tests here are screening aids. They look for patterns that are common in Parkinson's disease, but many other things — tiredness, caffeine, medication, anxiety, an unrelated condition, or simply an awkward grip on the phone — produce the same patterns. A concerning score does not mean you have Parkinson's disease, and a reassuring score does not rule it out.\n\nOnly a qualified clinician can diagnose Parkinson's disease, and only after an in-person examination. Take any result that worries you to your doctor, and never start, stop or change a medication based on what this app shows you.\n\nIf you have sudden or severe symptoms, seek medical help immediately rather than taking a test.",
